msgstr "إذا عُطِّل، لا يسجّل أي تسجيل حضور مصدره ولا يمكن تشغيل التحقق من الموقع."

#. Description of the 'May Send' (Check) field in DocType 'User Email'
#: onedesk/one_mail/custom/user_email.json
msgid "If disabled, they can read this mailbox but not send from it."
msgstr "عند التعطيل، يمكنه قراءة صندوق البريد هذا دون الإرسال منه."

#. Description of the 'OneAI Turned Off' (Check) field in DocType 'Email
#. Account'
#: onedesk/one_ai/custom/email_account.json
msgid "If enabled, OneAI can't read this mailbox, including in the OneAI panel."
msgstr "عند التفعيل، لا يستطيع OneAI قراءة صندوق البريد هذا، بما في ذلك في لوحة OneAI."

#. Description of the 'Audit OneAI Actions' (Check) field in DocType 'Reading
#. Settings'
#: onedesk/one_ai/doctype/reading_settings/reading_settings.json
msgid "If enabled, a second check approves what OneAI did with each document or sends it to a person."
msgstr "عند التفعيل، يوافق فحص ثانٍ على ما فعله OneAI بكل مستند أو يرسله إلى شخص."

#. Description of the 'ignore_user_time_overlap' field in DocType 'Projects
#. Settings'
#: onedesk/one_project/custom/projects_settings.json
msgid "If enabled, a user may log two timesheet rows for the same hours."
msgstr "إذا فُعّل، يمكن للمستخدم تسجيل صفين في سجل الوقت للساعات نفسها."

#. Description of the 'Submit Matching E-Invoices' (Check) field in DocType
#. 'Reading Settings'
#: onedesk/one_ai/doctype/reading_settings/reading_settings.json
msgid "If enabled, an e-invoice from a known supplier that matches its order is submitted."
msgstr "عند التفعيل، تُعتمد الفاتورة الإلكترونية من مورد معروف إذا طابقت طلبها."

#. Description of the 'ignore_employee_time_overlap' field in DocType 'Projects
#. Settings'
#: onedesk/one_project/custom/projects_settings.json
msgid "If enabled, an employee may log two timesheet rows for the same hours, such as a supervisor on two sites at once."
msgstr "إذا فُعّل، يمكن للموظف تسجيل صفين في سجل الوقت للساعات نفسها، مثل مشرف في موقعين في الوقت نفسه."

#. Description of the 'Announce Calls' (Check) field in DocType 'Sound Zone'
#: onedesk/one_display/doctype/sound_zone/sound_zone.json
