msgstr "عند التفعيل، يُعلن عن نداءات الطوابير في هذه المنطقة."

#. Description of the 'fetch_timesheet_in_sales_invoice' field in DocType
#. 'Projects Settings'
#: onedesk/one_project/custom/projects_settings.json
msgid "If enabled, choosing a project on a sales invoice adds its billable timesheets. Invoice Time on a project adds them either way."
msgstr "إذا فُعّل، يضيف اختيار مشروع في فاتورة المبيعات سجلات الوقت القابلة للفوترة. وزر فوترة الوقت في المشروع يضيفها في الحالتين."

#. Description of the 'Leave Unmatched Files in Place' (Check) field in DocType
#. 'Reading Settings'
#: onedesk/one_ai/doctype/reading_settings/reading_settings.json
msgid "If enabled, files that match no record stay where they arrived."
msgstr "عند التفعيل، تبقى الملفات التي لا تطابق أي سجل حيث وصلت."

#. Description of the 'Household' (Check) field in DocType 'Reading Settings'
#: onedesk/one_ai/doctype/reading_settings/reading_settings.json
msgid "If enabled, no drafts are made and Spending shows what was bought."
msgstr "عند التفعيل، لا تُنشأ مسودات ويعرض الإنفاق ما اشتُري."

#. Description of the 'Can upload' (Check) field in DocType 'Cloud Link'
#: onedesk/one_storage/doctype/cloud_link/cloud_link.json
msgid "If enabled, people with the link can upload files to the folder."
msgstr "عند التفعيل، يمكن لمن لديه الرابط رفع ملفات إلى المجلد."

#. Description of the 'Read Files Attached to Records' (Check) field in DocType
#. 'Reading Settings'
#: onedesk/one_ai/doctype/reading_settings/reading_settings.json
msgid "If enabled, scans and photos attached to records are also read, on behalf of the user who attached them."
msgstr "عند التفعيل، تُقرأ أيضاً المسوحات والصور المرفقة بالسجلات نيابةً عن المستخدم الذي أرفقها."

#. Description of the 'Fill Screen' (Check) field in DocType 'Display Slide'
#: onedesk/one_display/doctype/display_slide/display_slide.json
msgid "If enabled, the slide fills the screen and is cropped to fit."
msgstr "عند التفعيل، تملأ الشريحة الشاشة وتُقص لتناسبها."

#. Description of the 'Enabled' (Check) field in DocType 'Attendance Reason'
#: onedesk/one_hr/doctype/attendance_reason/attendance_reason.json
msgid "If enabled, this reason is offered on Attendance Requests."
msgstr "عند التفعيل، يُعرض هذا السبب في طلبات الحضور."

#. Description of the 'Paused' (Check) field in DocType 'Display Slide'
#: onedesk/one_display/doctype/display_slide/display_slide.json
msgid "If enabled, this row is skipped."
msgstr "عند التفعيل، يُتخطى هذا الصف."

#. Description of the 'Paused' (Check) field in DocType 'Display Track'
#: onedesk/one_display/doctype/display_track/display_track.json
msgid "If enabled, this track is skipped. Tracks made by OneAI are added paused."
msgstr "عند التفعيل، يُتخطى هذا المقطع. المقاطع التي يصنعها OneAI تُضاف متوقفة."

#. Description of the 'Plays Sound' (Check) field in DocType 'Display Screen'
#: onedesk/one_display/doctype/display_screen/display_screen.json
msgid "If enabled, videos with Plays Sound turned on play their audio."
msgstr "عند التفعيل، تُشغّل الفيديوهات المفعّل فيها «يشغّل الصوت» صوتها."

